        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-SER100012SAL, 12 Inch Modern Sierra Shower Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe very modern 12 Inch Sierra Shower Door Pull Set is made of 1 inch aluminum. Designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sharp look is desired, this shower door handle is available in a few finishes. It is packaged with everything you'll need to mount it back-to-back on 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SD-SER01012-specifications.gif?v=1704354739\" width=\"567\" height=\"246\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" alt=\"FII-SD-SER01012 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions SD-SER100012SAL Contemporary Shower Handles:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SD-SER01012-specifications.pdf?v=1704262331\"><b>First Impressions SD-SER100012SAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These modern shower door pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 4 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls and mounting hardware for back-to-back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
