                "description": "The very modern 12 Inch Sierra Shower Door Pull Set is made of 1 inch aluminum. Designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sharp look is desired, this shower door handle is available in a few finishes. It is packaged with everything you'll need to mount it back-to-back on 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower doors.\r\n",
